            "command": "gh pr create --title \"chore: #29 - Add \\\"Tesorer\u00eda\\\" Department in the menu\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\nThis PR adds the **Tesorer\u00eda** (Treasury) department to the navigation menu in the Finkargo Automation Hub. The implementation includes:\n\n- A new expandable/collapsible sidebar menu item for Tesorer\u00eda\n- A submenu item for \"Plantillas para Cargar NetSuite\" (NetSuite Templates for Upload)\n- A placeholder page component for the NetSuite templates functionality\n\n## Implementation Details\n\n### Key Changes\n\n- **`frontend/src/components/ui/FKSidebarWithCollapse.tsx`**: New sidebar component with collapsible menu support for Tesorer\u00eda, following the same tree layout pattern as the Finance department\n- **`frontend/src/pages/tesoreria/PlantillasNetSuite.tsx`**: New page component for the NetSuite templates functionality\n- **`frontend/src/App.tsx`**: Added routing for the new Tesorer\u00eda pages\n- **`implementations/20251129_tesoreria_menu.md`**: Implementation documentation\n- **`.claude/commands/e2e/test_tesoreria_menu.md`**: E2E test command for the new feature\n\n### Plan File\n\nSee [specs/issue-29-adw-11871436-sdlc_planner-add-tesoreria-menu.md](specs/issue-29-adw-11871436-sdlc_planner-add-tesoreria-menu.md) for the implementation plan.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Added Tesorer\u00eda menu item to sidebar\n- [x] Created tree layout with expandable submenu\n- [x] Added \"Plantillas para Cargar NetSuite\" submenu item\n- [x] Created placeholder page for NetSuite templates\n- [x] Added routing configuration\n- [x] Follows FK component naming convention\n- [x] Documentation added\n\n---\n\nCloses #29\n\n**ADW Tracking ID:** 11871436\nEOF\n)\" --base master",
